{
 "text": "I gave myself one hour to build an AI video editor, because it was taking 30 minutes to one hour to edit a single video, which was not good. But it took quite a lot of time, which I will tell you in the end of the video. But the basic thing goes like this: you put in your video, raw video, then AI analyzes it, and it cuts the dead spaces, and it adds in the caption, and it adds B-roll on top of it, and all I have to do is export it, put some background music on it, then it's done. Post it. And it took me five hours to build the version one of it, and this is far from the vision I had, but it's something, and the video you're watching right now is edited by this editor, so I would say this is a win, and this was episode two of making my tuition by January 15th.",
